411	// Nxeon NEVER downloads or mirrors the actual Workshop file here. For every
412	// family below, one of two things is true, confirmed against each game's own
413	// documentation (see docs/DOCUMENTATION.md's 2026-09-20 entry for the full
414	// citations and per-family confidence level — some of this is authoritative,
415	// a couple are best-available community evidence flagged as such):
