540	// --- Container env-var + recreate (ark, dst, squad, soulmask) ---
541	//
542	// Identical safety dance to worker/game-config.ts's `recreateGameContainer`
543	// (systemd-owned stop/rename/create/start/verify/rollback) — ported rather
544	// than imported because that function isn't exported and this file already
545	// keeps its own separate SSH transport from game-config.ts's; see that
546	// file's own comment on `resolveGameUnit` for why talking to docker directly,
547	// without going through systemd, is wrong on this platform.
